{"id":2281,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><style></style><div><p><br></p><p>近日，中国兵工学会（国家一级学会）公布2025年度兵器科学与技术学科高质量博士、硕士学位论文激励计划入选名单。本年度共评出高质量硕士学位论文8篇，提名论文5篇。我校2篇硕士论文成功入选，彰显了学科人才培养的卓越成效。</p><p>廖东桀硕士的学位论文《声共振辅助溶剂侵蚀技术制备球形炸药研究》（导师：安崇伟教授）入选高质量硕士学位论文；张东旭硕士的学位论文《微液滴技术调控HMX基含铝炸药微球及性能研究》（导师：武碧栋副教授）获高质量硕士学位论文提名。两篇论文均聚焦火炸药前沿技术，研究方向兼具创新性与应用价值，体现了学科在武器能源领域的科研深度与育人水平。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ToRftVolVRo7WkojzTknmGsM8-iL7lwZnl7DLllsnzvaUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSy4LSyPL1h7oRnVLNrRU4lYUzLbLR9iLRV7U4fVozMkLmrFUl7PUl-4UlMFLNlDUzlJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLR-DM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10266&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/53112D84E2ECC52A3908501DC0E93B25/AA1AB3AC/2E6A5\" vheight=\"372.2699890136719\" vwidth=\"260.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TMNltPnlWVUNWRUjl-bL4nVMzvZL4fw7o7MRUmU4Mzn7oR90gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDoSyPoSybU8-8UmN8oRLYol74LmNPoRWfLmf7M7WfMNVFUN7ZL4G8L7WFo7VRUmCJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLR-DM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10266&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Tn7CtbLzWkMz94njRfVLNWkL4f7oRNwZo7-aoRnfLNrRLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDoShfnSysLzUaU8UPMRUDM7W7UzW7UzWRn7-PLzNZnRfFoz-iUmU8ozAFL4GsM4GJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLR-DM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10266&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/769AE7140CD14464BDA2DA2CDB1198D0/925B4498/30770\" vheight=\"371.3299865722656\" vwidth=\"259.8800048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TnzQtRMzUDLl-4njNL4L8lDMm-YLR9wPL4l4n7WRnlWVUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSy4nSyZUSyPLmQkM8l4nlM2U874M8UYU4CZn7U8MmUDLRrFnRCZLm7snmrFo7Q2nz9Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLR-DM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10266&e=.png\"></p><p>长期以来，我校兵器科学与技术学科紧紧围绕国防人才强国战略，持续优化学科布局，强化创新研究方向凝练。通过强化导师责任、注重学术引领、营造创新氛围等措施，学科在拔尖创新人才培养方面取得显著进展，有力支撑了学校“双一流”创建与研究生教育质量全面提升。</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hjaq.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ToRftVolVRo7WkojzTknmGsM8-iL7lwZnl7DLllsnzvaUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSy4LSyPL1h7oRnVLNrRU4lYUzLbLR9iLRV7U4fVozMkLmrFUl7PUl-4UlMFLNlDUzlJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLR-DM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10266&e=.png"}